  "ontology_mappings_added": "2026-09-15 (schema v1.5.1): ontology_mappings added to every term. Each entry is an accepted match of the term's label, MeSH label or an alias to a term in MeSH, AIO, NCIT, OBI, SWO, STATO or EDAM, found with EBI OLS4, corroborated by Zooma, with every MeSH id confirmed at id.nlm.nih.gov. Sources, versions and rules: dome-ml-observatory-triage docs/vocabulary_ontology_mappings.md. Additive: no term, label, alias, mesh_id, definition or max_tags changed, and the key is not rendered into the enrichment prompt. An empty list means no accepted mapping."
